Средний объём за 7 завершённых дней, еди:
Volume across 7 completed days, units per day:
Very low: >0–<3; low: 3–<10; moderate: 10–<50;
high: 50–<200; very high: 200–<1,000; bulk sales: 1,000–<10,000;
huge volume: 10,000 or more. The same thresholds apply to every item type.
